    Then The API response status code should be 200
    And I extract data from response using JSON token "responsePayload.content[0].id" and store it as "MemberId"
    ## 2. Initiate Member Onetime Donation
    Then I store "{RandomInt:100,999}" value as "DonationAmount" variable
    Then I send a POST request to "/donation/create" with payload:
      """
      {
        "type": "ONETIME",
        "donorId": "{MemberId}",
        "amount": "{DonationAmount}",
        "forEventId": "EVT123"
      }
      """
    Then The API response status code should be 201
    And I extract data from response using JSON token "responsePayload.id" and store it as "DonationId"
    ## 3. Update Status to 'Paid' (Net Banking)
